    a) The universal CLI engine (CookieFuscator.ps1, universal_engine.py);
    b) The optical homoglyph token dictionary assets (confusing_dict.txt);
    c) The ProGuard rule generator and bytecode transformer pipelines;
    d) The Decoy Bytecode Virtualization Loader & Container (Bootstrap.class, engine.dat);
    e) The C++ JNI Native Sentinel Shield and PEB/Kernel anti-debugging libraries;
    f) Any configurations, scripts, tools, and technical documentation.

1.2 "Protected Artifacts" refers to third-party Minecraft plugins and JVM binaries 
    processed and protected using the Software.

